{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6cc4c627decd9f52f880a5759b1e17de.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"Illustration of an urban landscape with modern high-rise buildings in the background, a wooded area in the centre and various buildings in the foreground; above it, a hexagonal logo with a dark gemstone and below it, the lettering \u201cEMPLUNA\u201d.\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don't just build a city. Design it! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empluna is a building game in which you don't just place buildings, but plan, construct and design them yourself. From individual rooms in industrial facilities to entire streets, you decide how your city works.\u00a0<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6e907d74500242243220388f4369d353.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"A divider with the Empluna logo.\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on creative, guided construction: without restricting your freedom \u2013 the economy, society and resources support your decisions. Instead of a harsh economic simulation, the focus is on designing urban structures and living spaces. The result is a city that reacts dynamically to your actions and grows with you.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6e907d74500242243220388f4369d353.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"A divider with the Empluna logo.\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Modern Era</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take charge of a new urban project in the 21st century \u2013 founded to rethink modernity and coexistence. Starting from scratch, with unclear goals but plenty of creative freedom. <br> <br>Step by step, your city grows. New population groups move in, each with their own needs, desires and expectations.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/42d68ce0615e7530c95af21637a6213d.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"Six stylised avatar illustrations in green circles, each with different characteristics; they represent the spokespersons for the social groups of craftsmen, families, skilled workers, researchers, artists and tourists.\" width=1428 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Craftsmen, families, professionals, researchers, artists and tourists</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions determine which areas flourish and where challenges arise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From basic services such as schools and healthcare facilities to leisure activities such as sports facilities, race tracks and amusement parks. The result is a vibrant city that responds to your planning and is constantly evolving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You shape streets, squares and neighbourhoods. You bring your city to life. You build the world you imagine.<strong><i><u> </u></i></strong><br><strong><i><u> </u></i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6e907d74500242243220388f4369d353.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"A divider with the Empluna logo.\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of game mechanics give you, as the leader of the city project, the opportunity to turn your visions into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building &amp; Designing:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building system:</strong> Design buildings manually! From houses to industrial facilities to public buildings. The building plans you create can be reused and placed later.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrain:</strong> The landscape is procedurally generated and can be designed and customised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road network:</strong> Connect your city with roads for cars and lorries, or transport goods or people via the rail network. Race tracks and mountain lifts are also possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/adcad03a18654795c28ad699e782b9dd.poster.avif?t=1773504439\" aria-label=\"A moving image with two scenes. The scene on the left shows how to work the terrain and level the ground. The scene on the right shows how residential buildings are placed next to a post office.\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/adcad03a18654795c28ad699e782b9dd.webm?t=1773504439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/adcad03a18654795c28ad699e782b9dd.mp4?t=1773504439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy &amp; Goods:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various building types with individual characteristics and production possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource management through production, storage, import and export of goods.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A growing economy that responds to your planning and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/1f8ca479fd915bcbe1df90b978e9bec9.poster.avif?t=1773504439\" aria-label=\"A moving image with two scenes. The scene on the left shows how to draw roads using the road tool. The scene on the right shows how walls are erected to form a room in the building system.\" width=1170 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/1f8ca479fd915bcbe1df90b978e9bec9.webm?t=1773504439\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/1f8ca479fd915bcbe1df90b978e9bec9.mp4?t=1773504439\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Society &amp; needs:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different population groups with their own needs, desires and expectations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among other things, construction contracts, jobs and taxes influence quality of life.\u00a0 <br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6e907d74500242243220388f4369d353.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"A divider with the Empluna logo.\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you want to design cities, build houses, plan roads and play in a relaxed manner, <br> then Empluna is just the thing for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354960?t=1773504439","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/11c7d9b9767bb272c8ad58bbd7cdf5a8513c9221/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773504439","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/67da27a3ae25fa8b8f6a7100292caba47d34826d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773504439","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/67da27a3ae25fa8b8f6a7100292caba47d34826d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773504439","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6cc4c627decd9f52f880a5759b1e17de.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"Illustration of an urban landscape with modern high-rise buildings in the background, a wooded area in the centre and various buildings in the foreground; above it, a hexagonal logo with a dark gemstone and below it, the lettering \u201cEMPLUNA\u201d.\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Don't just build a city. Design it! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Empluna is a building game in which you don't just place buildings, but plan, construct and design them yourself. From individual rooms in industrial facilities to entire streets, you decide how your city works.\u00a0<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6e907d74500242243220388f4369d353.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"A divider with the Empluna logo.\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on creative, guided construction: without r