b_paragraph\" >You shape streets, squares and neighbourhoods. You bring your city to life. You build the world you imagine.<strong><i><u> </u></i></strong><br><strong><i><u> </u></i></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/6e907d74500242243220388f4369d353.avif?t=1773504439\" alt=\"A divider with the Empluna logo.\" width=1560 height=81 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of game mechanics give you, as the leader of the city project, the opportunity to turn your visions into reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building &amp; Designing:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Building system:</strong> Design buildings manually! From houses to industrial facilities to public buildings. The building plans you create can be reused and placed later.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Terrain:</strong> The landscape is procedurally generated and can be designed and customised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road network:</strong> Connect your city with roads for cars and lorries, or transport goods or people via the rail network. Race tracks and mountain lifts are also possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354960/extras/adcad03a18654795c28ad699e782b9dd.poster.avif?t=1773504439\" aria-label=\"A moving image with two scenes. The scene on the left shows how to work the terrain and level the ground. The scene on the right shows how residential buildings are placed next to a post office.\" width=1170 height=280 ><s